mysyspilot (1.4.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Packaging brought in line with Debian Policy / lintian:
    - real source package (debhelper 13, 3.0 native) built from src/.
    - program moved to /usr/share/mysyspilot, root helper to
      /usr/libexec/mysyspilot (FHS 3.0); polkit policy updated.
    - dropped dependency on essential util-linux; md5sums generated.
    - desktop and icon caches handled by dpkg triggers (no maintscripts).
    - AppStream metainfo added; manual page completed.
  * Disk helper is looked up in /usr/libexec first, /usr/lib as fallback.

